  <name>YuMusic</name>
  <summary>Listen to music and manage your library</summary>
  <developer id="dev.yumeo">
    <name>Yumeo</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      YuMusic is an independent music player for YouTube Music. Search for
      songs, explore albums and artists, and organize your listening queue
      in a dedicated desktop interface.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Sign in to access your library and manage playlists</li>
      <li>Read lyrics while listening</li>
      <li>Control playback with your desktop's media controls and media keys</li>
      <li>Adjust playback with shuffle, repeat, and crossfade</li>
      <li>Optionally share listening activity with ListenBrainz or Discord</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      An internet connection is required to stream music. Signing in with a
      Google account is required for personal library features. Availability
      of music depends on the service and your region.
    </p>
    <p>
      YuMusic is not affiliated with or endorsed by Google or YouTube.
    </p>
  </description>
